  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a quadratic polynomial with vertex <math><mi>V</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the integral <math><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As vertex is <math><mi>V</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;thus the quadratic is symmetric about <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Replacing&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Applying <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> in <math><mi>I</mi></math> and adding, we get,<br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
